  "ingredients": [
    "1 quart vegetable oil for deep-frying",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.66666668653488 cup milk",
    "2 large eggs, beaten",
    "1 tablespoon vegetable oil",
    "3 cups apples - peeled, cored and chopped",
    "1 cup cinnamon sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Heat oil in a deep fryer or electric skillet to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tuKEI-TIIevxjjTbifQng01wIi4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90295-moms-apple-fritters-DDMFS-01-11268-7dd3ce18563b48968a8678210061a01f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90295/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl. Pour in milk, eggs, and oil; stir until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yINsirCZP-poxCTvObwnM06Z_g0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90295-moms-apple-fritters-DDMFS-02-11282-b2f06f74b723458a923d9ffbf8c13bd5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90295/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in apples until evenly distributed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1hpkTFo-SHNpb8AC0rcE1Vlc3ys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90295-moms-apple-fritters-DDMFS-03-11284-09510a9806124c66ba3400772034e77b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90295/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in small batches to prevent overcrowding, drop spoonfuls of batter into the deep fryer and fry in hot oil until golden all over, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uXhLtK0t1KqyQeDSSOplFpaCwto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90295-moms-apple-fritters-DDMFS-04-11287-c1057f74f7f14e25a3c747664aa6b046.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90295/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a slotted spoon to transfer fritters to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Vl_05o08dpyoELI8JPIPKYD0fSo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90295-moms-apple-fritters-DDMFS-05-11289-26a03f2c0ed541c5af9ffb95924ca2c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90295/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss warm fritters with cinnamon sugar in a bowl until well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JniwPptsodCnqjWi_k8ZeKWn6oQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90295-moms-apple-fritters-DDMFS-06-11290-1d52157e2bf4458e9232c000033a43a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90295/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
